# Large or regenerable artifacts of the L0 investigation campaign.
# Committed evidence: bench/out/analysis/*.txt (analysis tables, generated by
# bench/report_data.sh) plus the per-stage run manifests (force-added: they carry the
# binary md5 / git head / rc identity of every run).
# Raw per-run CSVs, DB directories, the driver binary and the smoke DB stay on the
# machine only -- the same convention the repository already uses for other campaigns.
db/
base/
tools/
smoke/
tests/_scratch/
__pycache__/
*.core
core.*
# stage output directories (raw CSV/LOG/DB copies); out/analysis/ is re-included below
out/*/
!out/analysis/
out/analysis/*.json
out/analysis/*.csv
